    "title": "Biloxi council authorizes emergency bridge repairs in Woolmarket - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Parker Boyd ,\n1 days ago BILOXI, Miss. (WLOX) — The Biloxi City Council authorized repair work already completed at Parker Creek Bridge in Woolmarket. Biloxi Public Works discovered rotting wooden pilings under the bridge, leading to emergency repairs to stabilize the structure. The council formally authorized the repair and payment on Tuesday afternoon. The... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
